  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorption Defense</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif/revision/latest?cb=20201121020612\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20201121020612\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20201121020612 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/d7/Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif/revision/latest?cb=20201121020612 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal\" width=\"270\" height=\"151\" data-image-key=\"Naruto_Pain_Preta_Path_Blocking_Technique_Absorption_Seal.gif\" data-image-name=\"Naruto Pain Preta Path Blocking Technique Absorption Seal.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nagato/Pain (Naruto) uses the Blocking Technique Absorption Seal derived from the Preta Path to absorb chakra attacks in defense.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use absorption powers to defend oneself.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The ability to <b>use absorption powers to defend oneself</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Attacks\" title=\"Absorption Attacks\">Absorption Attacks</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Defense\" title=\"Theft Defense\">Theft Defense</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorption Defensiveness</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user possesses defensive skills that are enhanced by absorption powers, allowing them to block, parry, dodge, etc., with the power of absorption.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Infusion\" title=\"Absorption Infusion\">Absorption Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Exoskeleton\" title=\"Exoskeleton\">Exoskeleton</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Defense\">Peak Human</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Defense\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Defense\">Supernatural</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Defense\">Absolute Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wall_Generation\" title=\"Wall Generation\">Wall Generation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Combat\" title=\"Absorption Combat\">Absorption Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Combat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Combat\">Enhanced Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li>\n<li>Users will be exhausted when too much energy is used.</li>\n<li>May be over-charged/wounded if too much energy is used at once.</li>\n<li>Can only be used for defensive purposes.</li>\n<li>If the strength of the attack exceeds the tolerance limit of the absorption, then the defense will be broken.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Michael_Morningstar_(Classic)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Michael Morningstar (Classic)\">Michael Morningstar/Darkstar</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Yhwach\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Yhwach\">Yhwach</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li>Katsu (<i>Bobobo-bo Bobo-bo</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://classofthetitans.fandom.com/wiki/Theresa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:classofthetitans:Theresa\">Theresa</a> (<i>Class of the Titans</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dannyphantom.fandom.com/wiki/Danny_Fenton\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dannyphantom:Danny Fenton\">Danny Fenton/Phantom</a> (<i>Danny Phantom</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Lantern_Corps\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Lantern Corps\">Lantern Corps</a> (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Still_Force\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Still Force\">Still Force</a> conduits (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/Speed_Force\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dc:Speed Force\">Speed Force</a> conduits (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Naturon_Shenron\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dragonball:Naturon Shenron\">Naturon Shenron</a> (<i>Dragon Ball GT</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonball.fandom.com/wiki/Super_17\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dragonball:Super 17\">Super 17</a> (<i>Dragon Ball GT</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Kurapika\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Kurapika\">Kurapika</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Chrollo_Lucilfer\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Chrollo Lucilfer\">Chrollo Lucilfer</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Carne\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Carne\">Carne</a> (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>); via <a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Notorious_B.I.G.\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Notorious B.I.G.\">Notorious B.I.G.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Daniel_J._D%27Arby\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Daniel J. D&#39;Arby\">Daniel J. D'Arby</a> (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>); via <a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Osiris\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Osiris\">Osiris</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Enrico_Pucci\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Enrico Pucci\">Enrico Pucci</a> (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>); via <a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Whitesnake\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Whitesnake\">Whitesnake</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Ken_Oyanagi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:jojo:Ken Oyanagi\">K